        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-03-01T14:33:49.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Note also that Defend doesn't protect against any Damage dealt during Events unless otherwise specified, eg during the \"War Touches the Island's Shores\" Event, the Damage dealt when you discard the top Major Power for each land <em>can</em> be Defended against.</p>",
