        "id": 225825,
        "name": "dpt",
        "username": "dpt",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dpt/{size}/1922_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-03-01T14:47:52.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>(Events are only in Branch &amp; Claw, I suspect the OP has not broken that out yet.)</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>WRT Vital Strength of Earth's innate defense, note also that this can change during the turn, if a Sacred Site is destroyed (eg by adding Blight) or created (eg with the help of Spread of Rampant Green). If you use a power to create Defense in a land, it remains until the end of the turn, regardless of what else happens.</p>",
        "post_number": 4,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:59:33.918Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
