        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>(Events are only in Branch &amp; Claw, I suspect the OP has not broken that out yet.)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>WRT Vital Strength of Earth's innate defense, note also that this can change during the turn, if a Sacred Site is destroyed (eg by adding Blight) or created (eg with the help of Spread of Rampant Green). If you use a power to create Defense in a land, it remains until the end of the turn, regardless of what else happens.</p>",
